  "texts": {
    "preamble": "State Of Gujarat Thro' And On Behalf Of ... vs Babubhai Trikambhai ... on 9 September, 2017 Author: A.G.Uraizee Bench: A.G.Uraizee R/Cr.A/1122/2016 In The High Court Of Gujarat At Ahmedabad [Lok Adalat] Criminal Appeal (Against Acquittal) No. 1122 of 2016 ========================================================== State Of Gujarat Thro' And On Behalf Of Bhagubhai Shivabhai PRAJAPATI....Appellant(s) Versus Babubhai Trikambhai GODASARA....Opponent(s)/Respondent(s) ========================================================== Appearance: Ms. Jirga Jhaveri App for the Appellant(s) No. 1 Mr Dk Modi, Advocate for the Opponent(s)/Respondent(s) No. 1 Mr Md Modi, Advocate for the Opponent(s)/Respondent(s) No. 1 = = = = == == == == Coram: Honourable Mr.Justice A.G.Uraizee Date : 09/09/2017 Oral Order",
    "facts": "[3] It is submitted that the offeence alleged against the accused persons under the Prevention of Food Adulteration HC-NIC Page 1 of 2 Created On Sat Sep 16 12:01:01 IST 2017 R/CR.A/1122/2016 ORDER Act, is not serious in nature, the penalty/punishment prescribed for such offence is not substantial, and in view of the Sections 51 and 52 of the Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006, it is State Of Gujarat Thro' And On Behalf Of ... vs Babubhai Trikambhai ... on 9 September, 2017 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/48792699/ 1 compoundable under Section 69 of the Act. [4] In view of the withdrawal/settlement pursis, the present appeal stands disposed of. [5] The Record and Proceedings (R & P) is ordered to be remitted to the Trial Court forthwith. (A.G.URAIZEE, J) CHAIRPERSON M KUMAR HC-NIC Page 2 of 2 Created On Sat Sep 16 12:01:01 IST 2017 State Of Gujarat Thro' And On Behalf Of ... vs Babubhai Trikambhai ... on 9 September, 2017 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/48792699/ 2",
